#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:65
msgid "Command &Settings"
msgstr "A&pontiaedje del kimande"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:67
msgid "Output File Settings"
msgstr "Apontiaedje do fitchî d' sôrteye"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:68
msgid "Always use &file-extension:"
msgstr "Tofer eployî l' &cawete des fitchîs:"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:78
msgid ""
"<p>The command will use an output file. If checked, make sure the command "
"contains an output tag.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"Li cmande si sievrè d' on fitchî d' sôrteye. Si vs purdoz cisse tchuze "
"la, waitîz bén ki li cmande evoye po do bon ene sacwè come sôrteye.</p>"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:81
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p>The command to execute when printing on this special printer. Either "
"enter the command to execute directly, or associate/create a command object "
"with/for this special printer. The command object is the preferred method as "
"it provides support for advanced settings like mime type checking, "
"configurable options and requirement list (the plain command is only "
"provided for backward compatibility). When using a plain command, the "
"following tags are recognized:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%in</b>: the input file (required).</li>"
"<li><b>%out</b>: the output file (required if using an output "
"file).</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: the paper size in lower case.</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: the paper size with the first letter in upper "
"case.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Li cmande a eployî po fé rexhe ene sacwè so li scrirece sipeciåle. "
"Vos poloz taper direk li cmande a eployî  ou don bén aloyî 'ne kimande a "
"li scrirece ou loyî après èn objet di cmande. I våt mî eployî ene "
"kimande, ca vos pôroz defini des spepieusès tchuzes, come metans: li "
"verifiaedje des sôres mime, des tchuzes a vosse môde, des djivêyes di "
"prérekis (li cmande tote seule n' est la k' pol copatibilité èn erî). "
"Avou 'ne kimande, ces shûtes la sont ricnoxhowes:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%in</b>: li fitchî d' intrêye (doet esse la).</li>"
"<li><b>%out</b>: li fitchî d' sôrteye (doet esse la si vs eployîz on "
"fitchî d' sôrteye).</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: li grandeu do papî (e ptitès letes).</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: li grandeu do papî (li prumire lete est grande).</li></ul>"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:92
msgid "<p>The default extension for the output file (<u>ex</u>: ps, pdf, ps.gz).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Li prémetowe cawete pol fitchî d' sôrteye (<u>eg</u>: ps, pdf, "
"ps.gz).</p>"

#: kdeprint/management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:136
msgid "You must provide a non-empty name."
